<section
    class="bg-brand-secondary sticky top-0 z-0 flex min-h-screen w-full items-center justify-center px-6 py-12 text-white md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    <div
        class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-350 grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div
            class="flex flex-col gap-6 border-b border-white/20 pb-8 md:gap-8 md:border-r md:border-b-0 md:pr-10 md:pb-0 lg:pr-16">
            <h2 class="text-5xl leading-none font-bold tracking-wide md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
                <span class="block">About</span>
                <span class="block">us</span>
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed font-medium md:text-lg lg:text-xl">
                <p>
                    ACISLAB is an interdisciplinary research laboratory at the Instituto Tecnológico
                    de Sonora (ITSON) dedicated to advancing the fields of Affective Computing and
                    Health Informatics. Our efforts focus on generating novel knowledge useful to
                    design and build:
                </p>
                <p>
                    Intelligent systems that not only optimize tasks but are also capable of
                    understanding, modeling, and responding to the human cognitive and emotional
                    condition.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Computing systems that enhance the well-being of People with Dementia and their
                    caregivers in real-world settings.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-6 md:gap-8">
            <h2 class="text-5xl leading-none font-bold tracking-wide md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
                <span class="block">Research</span>
                <span class="block">vision</span>
            </h2>

            <div
                class="flex-1 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed font-medium md:text-lg lg:text-xl">
                <p>
                    ACISLAB operates at the intersection of Affective Computing, Intelligent
                    Systems, Software Engineering, and Human-Computer Interaction.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Unlike purely data-driven or “black-box” AI approaches, our research emphasizes
                    formal, explainable, and methodologically grounded models of cognition and
                    emotion.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We develop Computational Models of Emotion, study how emotional processes
                    influence cognition and decision-making, and design architectures for cognitive
                    and affective agents capable of interacting naturally with users.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 flex justify-end">
                <img
                    src="/images/itson-logo.png"
                    alt="ITSON Universidad"
                    class="h-10 w-auto object-contain opacity-90 md:h-12"
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
